    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create the ultimate scare-sperience in You Can\u2019t Scare Me - a haunted house game where you can scare or be scared!\u00a0 Team up to scare your friends - or your friends can try to scare you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore 8 creepy levels to find hidden treasures.\u00a0 Set scary traps to frighten your friends - and get points if they scream!\u00a0 Stay invisible and stage creepy encounters all around them - or appear in front of them as a terrifying monster to make them really flip their lid!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can you freak out your friend enough to reduce them to a shadow of their former selves? Can your friend keep their cool long enough to find the hidden keys and escape the horrible nightmare you\u2019ve crafted for them??</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find out - in You Can\u2019t Scare Me!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-Multiplayer Mode - Play with up to 4 friends online</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-Single Player Mode - Play against the computer</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-Party Mode - Set up a level, and pass the headset to a friend to play it</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-8 freaky levels including an abandoned theme park, empty hospital, liminal spaces, and more</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-8 bone-chilling costumes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-50 scare traps, from unnerving to positively horrifying</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create the ultimate scare-sperience in You Can\u2019t Scare Me - a haunted house game where you can scare or be scared!\u00a0 Team up to scare your friends - or your friends can try to scare you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore 8 creepy levels to find hidden treasures.\u00a0 Set scary traps to frighten your friends - and get points if they scream!\u00a0 Stay invisible and stage creepy encounters all around them - or appear in front of them as a terrifying monster to make them really flip their lid!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can you freak out your friend enough to reduce them to a shadow of their former selves? Can your friend keep their cool long enough to find the hidden keys and escape the horrible nightmare you\u2019ve crafted for them??</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find out - in You Can\u2019t Scare Me!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-Multiplayer Mode - Play with up to 4 friends online</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-Single Player Mode - Play against the computer</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-Party Mode - Set up a level, and pass the headset to a friend to play it</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-8 freaky levels including an abandoned theme park, empty hospital, liminal spaces, and more</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-8 bone-chilling costumes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-50 scare traps, from unnerving to positively horrifying</p>",
